Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='settingspage', at=datetime(2026, 10, 9, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title="The settings page shows what is connected, by group, read-only, and draws the Inbox's own open cards", body="The page (`#/settings`) is what is connected, by group (2026-10-09, stage 2; `settings::overview`, `GET /api/overview`): one reading of the instance and the stores, a group nothing is connected to only offered with Ask, every line in the owner's words (no key name) and read-only, because the instance file is the one writer of deployment; a line draws the Inbox's own OPEN CARDS, placed by the reading (one per need, on the first line that needs it) and named by reference, so the page invents no act UI; no reading names a secret (a secret card's act carries its label), though the inbox's stored `Act::Secret` still does, so a replica's objects carry it until that format changes. The page writes nothing: no route changes a setting, and the Models group only says which Claude model each job runs.", rationale='Decided 2026-10-09 (setup agent stage 2).', supersedes=()))